></path></svg></div><div style="height:0" class="toggle__ToggleContentsContainer-sc-e0810304-0 eeQJDZ"><div class="toggle__ToggleBlockDescriptionWrapper-sc-c261c5ac-2 ebWLuA"><div align="left" class="career-text__Textstyled-sc-d4647b24-0 hzhMTi"><p id="isPasted"><strong>A.  </strong><strong><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="7200171100071b06321f07011b1c01135c111d1f">[email&#160;protected]</a></strong>으로 요청해 주세요.</p><ul><li>메일 제목 : <strong>[면접확인서요청] 공고명_지원자명</strong><br/><em>예시: [면접확인서요청] Recruiter_김무신사</em><br/><br/></li><li>메일 내용 : <strong>차수 / 성함 / 연락처 / 면접 진행 날짜 / 기타 요청 사항 </strong><em><br/>예시: 1차 / 김무신사 / 010-0000-0000 / 2025-11-01 /  기관 제출용입니다.</em></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="layout__Container-sc-2396a3cf-0 gcMYSU layout"><div class="layout__PageContainer-sc-2396a3cf-1 jvmtii layout"><div class="layout__ColumnWrapper-sc-2396a3cf-2 bLxIzA"><div class="column__ColumnContainer-sc-32f87c75-0 BeFrH"><div background="[object Object]" class="column__Container-sc-32f87c75-1 cVUTES column" id="7e44818d-cfa2-44ca-b8ac-d8529d391dc1" blocks="[object Object],[object Object]" brandColor="#000000"><div style="position:relative" class="sc-kAkozD fCdkMv"><div id="105bc645-5324-4a81-81f4-6d3aeace88da" type="blank" blank="[object Object]" class="blank__Blank-sc-f3cd2325-0 gakHtD"></div><h3 brandColor="#000000" id="0c56e534-096a-4fb9-a0c4-24004e7d6611" type="text" align="left" content="&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);&quot;&gt;지원 관련&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" background="[object Object]" class="career-text__Textstyled-sc-d4647b24-0 dPSVFW text__Container-sc-ee98b209-0 gRMXeC"><p><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34)">지원 관련</span></p></h3></div></div></div><div class="column__ColumnContainer-sc-32f87c75-0 lgbWbm"><div background="[object Object]" class="column__Container-sc-32f87c75-1 cVUTES column" id="42d6c832-fe82-48aa-8f34-0069e637d975" blocks="[object Object]" brandColor="#000000"><div style="position:relative" class="sc-kAkozD fCdkMv"><div class="sc-kAkozD cPifFj toggle__ToggleBlockContainer-sc-c261c5ac-3 jZVMUB"><div class="toggle__ToggleBlockContentContainer-sc-c261c5ac-0 jptlpY"><div style="cursor:pointer" class="sc-gFVuLS ujPNE toggle__ToggleBlockTitleContainer-sc-c261c5ac-1 irQwbf"><h3 align="left" class="career-text__Textstyled-sc-d4647b24-0 dPSVFW"><p>Q. 이력서 양식이 있나요?</p></h3><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="toggle-arrow" color="var(--x171smmw)" style="flex-shrink:0"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M18.3536 13.9393C18.5489 14.1346 18.5489 14.4512 18.3536 14.6464L17.6465 15.3535C17.4512 15.5488 17.1346 15.5488 16.9394 15.3535L12 10.4142L7.06071 15.3535C6.86544 15.5488 6.54886 15.5488 6.3536 15.3535L5.64649 14.6464C5.45123 14.4512 5.45123 14.1346 5.64649 13.9393L11.6465 7.93933C11.8418 7.74406 12.1583 7.74406 12.3536 7.93933L18.3536 13.9393Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><div style="height:0" class="toggle__ToggleContentsContainer-sc-e0810304-0 eeQJDZ"><div class="toggle__ToggleBlockDescriptionWrapper-sc-c261c5ac-2 ebWLuA"><div align="left" class="career-text__Textstyled-sc-d4647b24-0 hzhMTi"><p><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34)">A.  별도의 이력서 양식은 존재하지 않으니 </span><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34)">어떤 업무 경험을 하셨는지 잘 알 수 있는 이력서 및 경력기술서를 자유롭게 작성해 제출해주세요.</span></p><p><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34)">다만, 특정 포지션의 경우 서류에서 중점적으로 확인하는 부분이 있으니 채용공고를 확인해 주세요.</span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="toggle__ToggleBlockContentContainer-sc-c261c5ac-0 jptlpY"><div style="cursor:pointer" class="sc-gFVuLS ujPNE toggle__ToggleBlockTitleContainer-sc-c261c5ac-1 irQwbf"><h3 align="left" class="career-text__Textstyled-sc-d4647b24-0 dPSVFW"><p>Q. 다수 포지션, 여러 계열사(포지션)로 중복지원도 가능한가요?</p></h3><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="toggle-arrow" color="var(--x171smmw)" style="flex-shrink:0"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M18.3536 13.9393C18.5489 14.1346 18.5489 14.4512 18.3536 14.6464L17.6465 15.3535C17.4512 15.5488 17.1346 15.5488 16.9394 15.3535L12 10.4142L7.06071 15.3535C6.86544 15.5488 6.54886 15.5488 6.3536 15.3535L5.64649 14.6464C5.45123 14.4512 5.45123 14.1346 5.64649 13.9393L11.6465 7.93933C11.8418 7.74406 12.1583 7.74406 12.3536 7.93933L18.3536 13.9393Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><div style="height:0" class="toggle__ToggleContentsContainer-sc-e0810304-0 eeQJDZ"><div class="toggle__ToggleBlockDescriptionWrapper-sc-c261c5ac-2 ebWLuA"><div align="left" class="career-text__Textstyled-sc-d4647b24-0 hzhMTi"><p id="isPasted">A. 지원자분께서 생각하시기에 가장 잘 맞는 포지션에 지원해 주세요. </p><p>채용담당자가 확인 후 더 적합한 포지션이 있다면, 유연하게 다른 포지션을 제안드릴 수도 있어요.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="toggle__ToggleBlockContentContainer-sc-c261c5ac-0 jptlpY"><div style="cursor:pointer" class="sc-gFVuLS ujPNE toggle__ToggleBlockTitleContainer-sc-c261c5ac-1 irQwbf"><h3 align="left" class="career-text__Textstyled-sc-d4647b24-0 dPSVFW"><p>Q. 제출 완료한 지원서를 수정할 수 있나요?</p></h3><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="toggle-arrow" color="var(--x171smmw)" style="flex-shrink:0"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M18.3536 13.9393C18.5489 14.1346 18.5489 14.4512 18.3536 14.6464L17.6465 15.3535C17.4512 15.5488 17.1346 15.5488 16.9394 15.3535L12 10.4142L7.06071 15.3535C6.86544 15.5488 6.54886 15.5488 6.3536 15.3535L5.64649 14.6464C5.45123 14.4512 5.45123 14.1346 5.64649 13.9393L11.6465 7.93933C11.8418 7.74406 12.1583 7.74406 12.3536 7.93933L18.3536 13.9393Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><div style="height:0" class="toggle__ToggleContentsContainer-sc-e0810304-0 eeQJDZ"><div class="toggle__ToggleBlockDescriptionWrapper-sc-c261c5ac-2 ebWLuA"><div align="left" class="career-text__Textstyled-sc-d4647b24-0 hzhMTi"><p>A. 기제출된 서류의 수정은 불가능하며, 재지원으로 수정 서류를 업로드 해주셔야 해요.<br id="isPasted"/>재지원 예정이실 경우, <strong><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="ec9e898f9e998598ac81999f85829f8dc28f8381">[email&#160;protected]</a></strong>으로<strong> </strong>삭제 요청 주시면 기존 지원 서류를 삭제해드릴게요.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="toggle__ToggleBlockContentContainer-sc-c261c5ac-0 jptlpY"><div style="cursor:pointer" class="sc-gFVuLS ujPNE toggle__ToggleBlockTitleContainer-sc-c261c5ac-1 irQwbf"><h3 align="left" class="career-text__Textstyled-sc-d4647b24-0 dPSVFW"><p>Q.  자격 요건에 명시된 경력 조건이 미달 시 지원 불가한가요?</p></h3><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="toggle-arrow" color="var(--x171smmw)" style="flex-shrink:0"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M18.3536 13.9393C18.5489 14.1346 18.5489 14.4512 18.3536 14.6464L17.6465 15.3535C17.4512 15.5488 17.1346 15.5488 16.9394 15.3535L12 10.4142L7.06071 15.3535C6.86544 15.5488 6.54886 15.5488 6.3536 15.3535L5.64649 14.6464C5.45123 14.4512 5.45123 14.1346 5.64649 13.9393L11.6465 7.93933C11.8418 7.74406 12.1583 7.74406 12.3536 7.93933L18.3536 13.9393Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><div style="height:0" class="toggle__ToggleContentsContainer-sc-e0810304-0 eeQJDZ"><div class="toggle__ToggleBlockDescriptionWrapper-sc-c261c5ac-2 ebWLuA"><div align="left" class="career-text__Textstyled-sc-d4647b24-0 hzhMTi"><p>A. 직무 기술서에 명시된 자격 요건이 모두 일치해야만 지원이 가능한 것은 아니에요. 경력 연차가 일치하지 않더라도 그에 준하는 역량과 경험이 있다면 지원이 가능해요.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="toggle__ToggleBlockContentContainer-sc-c261c5ac-0 jptlpY"><div style="cursor:pointer" class="sc-gFVuLS ujPNE toggle__ToggleBlockTitleContainer-sc-c261c5ac-1 irQwbf"><h3 align="left" class="career-text__Textstyled-sc-d4647b24-0 dPSVFW"><p>Q. 제가 지원한 서류의 진행 상황을 알 수 있을까요?</p></h3><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="toggle-arrow" color="var(--x171smmw)" style="flex-shrink:0"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M18.3536 13.9393C18.5489 14.1346 18.5489 14.4512 18.3536 14.6464L17.6465 15.3535C17.4512 15.5488 17.1346 15.5488 16.9394 15.3535L12 10.4142L7.06071 15.3535C6.86544 15.5488 6.54886 15.5488 6.3536 15.3535L5.64649 14.6464C5.45123 14.4512 5.45123 14.1346 5.64649 13.9393L11.6465 7.93933C11.8418 7.74406 12.1583 7.74406 12.3536 7.93933L18.3536 13.9393Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><div style="height:0" class="toggle__ToggleContentsContainer-sc-e0810304-0 eeQJDZ"><div class="toggle__ToggleBlockDescriptionWrapper-sc-c261c5ac-2 ebWLuA"><div align="left" class="career-text__Textstyled-sc-d4647b24-0 hzhMTi"><p>A. 먼저 무신사에 관심을 갖고 지원해주신 점 감사드려요. </p><p>제출해주신 서류는 포지션별로 담당 부서에서 순차적으로 검토 중에 있으며, 검토가 완료된 분들에게는 개별적으로 결과 안내를 드리고 있어요. 결과는 준비되는 대로 빠르게 안내드릴게요.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="toggle__ToggleBlockContentContainer-sc-c261c5ac-0 jptlpY"><div style="cursor:pointer" class="sc-gFVuLS ujPNE toggle__ToggleBlockTitleContainer-sc-c261c5ac-1 irQwbf"><h3 align="left" class="career-text__Textstyled-sc-d4647b24-0 dPSVFW"><p>Q. 불합격인 경우에도 결과 안내를 받을 수 있나요?</p></h3><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="toggle-arrow" color="var(--x171smmw)" style="flex-shrink:0"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M18.3536 13.9393C18.5489 14.1346 18.5489 14.4512 18.3536 14.6464L17.6465 15.3535C17.4512 15.5488 17.1346 15.5488 16.9394 15.3535L12 10.4142L7.06071 15.3535C6.86544 15.5488 6.54886 15.5488 6.3536 15.3535L5.64649 14.6464C5.45123 14.4512 5.45123 14.1346 5.64649 13.9393L11.6465 7.93933C11.8418 7.74406 12.1583 7.74406 12.3536 7.93933L18.3536 13.9393Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><div style="height:0" class="toggle__ToggleContentsContainer-sc-e0810304-0 eeQJDZ"><div class="toggle__ToggleBlockDescriptionWrapper-sc-c261c5ac-2 ebWLuA"><div align="left" class="career-text__Textstyled-sc-d4647b24-0 hzhMTi"><p>A. 결과는 합격 여부와 관계없이 지원해주신 모든 분들께 안내드리고 있어요.</p><p>신중한 검토로 결과 안내가 조금 늦어질 수는 있지만, 누락 없이 꼭 연락드릴 예정이니 조금만 기다려주세요.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="toggle__ToggleBlockContentContainer-sc-c261c5ac-0 jptlpY"><div style="cursor:pointer" class="sc-gFVuLS ujPNE toggle__ToggleBlockTitleContainer-sc-c261c5ac-1 irQwbf"><h3 align="left" class="career-text__Textstyled-sc-d4647b24-0 dPSVFW"><p>Q. 전형 단계별 피드백을 받을 수 있나요?</p></h3><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="toggle-arrow" color="var(--x171smmw)" style="flex-shrink:0"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M18.3536 13.9393C18.5489 14.1346 18.5489 14.4512 18.3536 14.6464L17.6465 15.3535C17.4512 15.5488 17.1346 15.5488 16.9394 15.3535L12 10.4142L7.06071 15.3535C6.86544 15.5488 6.54886 15.5488 6.3536 15.3535L5.64649 14.6464C5.45123 14.4512 5.45123 14.1346 5.64649 13.9393L11.6465 7.93933C11.8418 7.74406 12.1583 7.74406 12.3536 7.93933L18.3536 13.9393Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><div style="height:0" class="toggle__ToggleContentsContainer-sc-e0810304-0 eeQJDZ"><div class="toggle__ToggleBlockDescriptionWrapper-sc-c261c5ac-2 ebWLuA"><div align="left" class="career-text__Textstyled-sc-d4647b24-0 hzhMTi"><p>A. 무신사는 공정한 채용 절차 준수를 위해 전형 결과에 대한 개별 피드백은 제공하고 있지 않아요.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="toggle__ToggleBlockContentContainer-sc-c261c5ac-0 jptlpY"><div style="cursor:pointer" class="sc-gFVuLS ujPNE toggle__ToggleBlockTitleContainer-sc-c261c5ac-1 irQwbf"><h3 align="left" class="career-text__Textstyled-sc-d4647b24-0 dPSVFW"><p>Q. 전에 인터뷰를 진행했었는데, 새로운 지원에도 영향을 미치나요?</p></h3><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="toggle-arrow" color="var(--x171smmw)" style="flex-shrink:0"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M18.3536 13.9393C18.5489 14.1346 18.5489 14.4512 18.3536 14.6464L17.6465 15.3535C17.4512 15.5488 17.1346 15.5488 16.9394 15.3535L12 10.4142L7.06071 15.3535C6.86544 15.5488 6.54886 15.5488 6.3536 15.3535L5.64649 14.6464C5.45123 14.4512 5.45123 14.1346 5.64649 13.9393L11.6465 7.93933C11.8418 7.74406 12.1583 7.74406 12.3536 7.93933L18.3536 13.9393Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><div style="height:0" class="toggle__ToggleContentsContainer-sc-e0810304-0 eeQJDZ"><div class="toggle__ToggleBlockDescriptionWrapper-sc-c261c5ac-2 ebWLuA"><div align="left" class="career-text__Textstyled-sc-d4647b24-0 hzhMTi"><p><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34)">A. 매 지원은 별도로 새롭게 평가하고 있고, </span><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34)">이번 지원도 공정하고 객관적으로 검토되고 있어요.</span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="toggle__ToggleBlockContentContainer-sc-c261c5ac-0 jptlpY"><div style="cursor:pointer" class="sc-gFVuLS ujPNE toggle__ToggleBlockTitleContainer-sc-c261c5ac-1 irQwbf"><h3 align="left" class="career-text__Textstyled-sc-d4647b24-0 dPSVFW"><p>Q. 포지션이 마감된 것 같은데, 이메일로 접수가 가능할까요?</p></h3><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="toggle-arrow" color="var(--x171smmw)" style="flex-shrink:0"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M18.3536 13.9393C18.5489 14.1346 18.5489 14.4512 18.3536 14.6464L17.6465 15.3535C17.4512 15.5488 17.1346 15.5488 16.9394 15.3535L12 10.4142L7.06071 15.3535C6.86544 15.5488 6.54886 15.5488 6.3536 15.3535L5.64649 14.6464C5.45123 14.4512 5.45123 14.1346 5.64649 13.9393L11.6465 7.93933C11.8418 7.74406 12.1583 7.74406 12.3536 7.93933L18.3536 13.9393Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><div style="height:0" class="toggle__ToggleContentsContainer-sc-e0810304-0 eeQJDZ"><div class="toggle__ToggleBlockDescriptionWrapper-sc-c261c5ac-2 ebWLuA"><div align="left" class="career-text__Textstyled-sc-d4647b24-0 hzhMTi"><p><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34)">A. 모든 채용 지원을 공식 홈페이지에서 받고 있어서, 이메일로 별도 접수는 어려워요.</span></p><p><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34)">지원하고자 하는 포지션이 홈페이지에 등록되어 있지 않은 경우에는, 해당 채용이 마감되었거나 진행되지 않는 상태일 수 있어요.</span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="toggle__ToggleBlockContentContainer-sc-c261c5ac-0 jptlpY"><div style="cursor:pointer" class="sc-gFVuLS ujPNE toggle__ToggleBlockTitleContainer-sc-c261c5ac-1 irQwbf"><h3 align="left" class="career-text__Textstyled-sc-d4647b24-0 dPSVFW"><p>Q. 외국인도 지원이 가능한가요?</p></h3><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="toggle-arrow" color="var(--x171smmw)" style="flex-shrink:0"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M18.3536 13.9393C18.5489 14.1346 18.5489 14.4512 18.3536 14.6464L17.6465 15.3535C17.4512 15.5488 17.1346 15.5488 16.9394 15.3535L12 10.4142L7.06071 15.3535C6.86544 15.5488 6.54886 15.5488 6.3536 15.3535L5.64649 14.6464C5.45123 14.4512 5.45123 14.1346 5.64649 13.9393L11.6465 7.93933C11.8418 7.74406 12.1583 7.74406 12.3536 7.93933L18.3536 13.9393Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><div style="height:0" class="toggle__ToggleContentsContainer-sc-e0810304-0 eeQJDZ"><div class="toggle__ToggleBlockDescriptionWrapper-sc-c261c5ac-2 ebWLuA"><div align="left" class="career-text__Textstyled-sc-d4647b24-0 hzhMTi"><p>A. 대한민국에서 취업이 가능한 비자가 있는 외국인은 지원하실 수 있어요.</p><p>다만, 무신사의 채용 전형은 모두 한국어로 진행되며, 입사 후 담당 직무에서도 한국어로 자유롭게 의사소통에 가능해야 하는 점 참고 부탁드릴게요.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="layout__Container-sc-2396a3cf-0 gcMYSU layout"><div class="layout__PageContainer-sc-2396a3cf-1 jvmtii layout"><div class="layout__ColumnWrapper-sc-2396a3cf-2 bLxIzA"><div class="column__ColumnContainer-sc-32f87c75-0 eDqbtp"><div background="[object Object]" class="column__Container-sc-32f87c75-1 cVUTES column" id="04f0b3f9-2964-402a-84fe-2e9befd88632" blocks="[object Object]" brandColor="#000000"><div style="position:relative" class="sc-kAkozD fCdkMv"><div id="c9670b7e-c87c-4d09-bacd-c82242bfd1dc" type="blank" blank="[object Object]" class="blank__Blank-sc-f3cd2325-0 gakHuU"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="layout__Container-sc-2396a3cf-0 gcMYSU layout"><div class="layout__PageContainer-sc-2396a3cf-1 jvmtii layout"><div class="layout__ColumnWrapper-sc-2396a3cf-2 bLxIzA"><div class="column__ColumnContainer-sc-32f87c75-0 BeFrH"><div background="[object Object]" class="column__Container-sc-32f87c75-1 cVUTES column" id="7a5f0cef-5955-491b-ba7c-58c36a262696" blocks="[object Object],[object Object]" brandColor="#000000"><div style="position:relative" class="sc-kAkozD fCdkMv"><div id="f24dfc15-6c87-41e7-bbdf-14486e274b5f" type="blank" blank="[object Object]" class="blank__Blank-sc-f3cd2325-0 gakHtD"></div><h3 brandColor="#000000" id="449d4da0-3b49-414f-a12d-6e4fd6a98455" type="text" align="left" content="&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);&quot;&gt;전형 진행&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;관련&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" background="[object Object]" class="career-text__Textstyled-sc-d4647b24-0 dPSVFW text__Container-sc-ee98b209-0 gRMXeC"><p><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34)">전형 진행</span><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34)"> 관련</span></p></h3></div></div></div><div class="column__ColumnContainer-sc-32f87c75-0 lgbWbm"><div background="[object Object]" class="column__Container-sc-32f87c75-1 cVUTES column" id="bb5f5c1b-3abe-4e34-9ed1-31cbc3d75f7a" blocks="[object Object]" brandColor="#000000"><div style="position:relative" class="sc-kAkozD fCdkMv"><div class="sc-kAkozD cPifFj toggle__ToggleBlockContainer-sc-c261c5ac-3 jZVMUB"><div class="toggle__ToggleBlockContentContainer-sc-c261c5ac-0 jptlpY"><div style="cursor:pointer" class="sc-gFVuLS ujPNE toggle__ToggleBlockTitleContainer-sc-c261c5ac-1 irQwbf"><h3 align="left" class="career-text__Textstyled-sc-d4647b24-0 dPSVFW"><p>Q. 과제 전형은 어떤 방식으로 진행되나요?</p></h3><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="toggle-arrow" color="var(--x171smmw)" style="flex-shrink:0"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M18.3536 13.9393C18.5489 14.1346 18.5489 14.4512 18.3536 14.6464L17.6465 15.3535C17.4512 15.5488 17.1346 15.5488 16.9394 15.3535L12 10.4142L7.06071 15.3535C6.86544 15.5488 6.54886 15.5488 6.3536 15.3535L5.64649 14.6464C5.45123 14.4512 5.45123 14.1346 5.64649 13.9393L11.6465 7.93933C11.8418 7.74406 12.1583 7.74406 12.3536 7.93933L18.3536 13.9393Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><div style="height:0" class="toggle__ToggleContentsContainer-sc-e0810304-0 eeQJDZ"><div class="toggle__ToggleBlockDescriptionWrapper-sc-c261c5ac-2 ebWLuA"><div align="left" class="career-text__Textstyled-sc-d4647b24-0 hzhMTi"><p>A. 과제는 지원한 포지션의 직무 역량과 연관된 주제로, 5일 혹은 7일의 기간을 드리고 있어요.</p><p>단, 일부 포지션의 경우 온라인 코딩 테스트와 같이 문제 출제 방식 등의 형식으로 진행되는 경우도 있으니 전달 받으신 과제 안내 메일을 참고해주세요.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="toggle__ToggleBlockContentContainer-sc-c261c5ac-0 jptlpY"><div style="cursor:pointer" class="sc-gFVuLS ujPNE toggle__ToggleBlockTitleContainer-sc-c261c5ac-1 irQwbf"><h3 align="left" class="career-text__Textstyled-sc-d4647b24-0 dPSVFW"><p>Q. 인터뷰 진행 시 복장 규정이 있나요?</p></h3><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="toggle-arrow" color="var(--x171smmw)" style="flex-shrink:0"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M18.3536 13.9393C18.5489 14.1346 18.5489 14.4512 18.3536 14.6464L17.6465 15.3535C17.4512 15.5488 17.1346 15.5488 16.9394 15.3535L12 10.4142L7.06071 15.3535C6.86544 15.5488 6.54886 15.5488 6.3536 15.3535L5.64649 14.6464C5.45123 14.4512 5.45123 14.1346 5.64649 13.9393L11.6465 7.93933C11.8418 7.74406 12.1583 7.74406 12.3536 7.93933L18.3536 13.9393Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><div style="height:0" class="toggle__ToggleContentsContainer-sc-e0810304-0 eeQJDZ"><div class="toggle__ToggleBlockDescriptionWrapper-sc-c261c5ac-2 ebWLuA"><div align="left" class="career-text__Textstyled-sc-d4647b24-0 hzhMTi"><p id="isPasted">A. 정해진 복장 규정이 없어요. 편안하고 자유롭게 입고 참여해주세요.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="toggle__ToggleBlockContentContainer-sc-c261c5ac-0 jptlpY"><div style="cursor:pointer" class="sc-gFVuLS ujPNE toggle__ToggleBlockTitleContainer-sc-c261c5ac-1 irQwbf"><h3 align="left" class="career-text__Textstyled-sc-d4647b24-0 dPSVFW"><p>Q. 비대면 인터뷰로 변경할 수 있을까요?</p></h3><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="toggle-arrow" color="var(--x171smmw)" style="flex-shrink:0"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M18.3536 13.9393C18.5489 14.1346 18.5489 14.4512 18.3536 14.6464L17.6465 15.3535C17.4512 15.5488 17.1346 15.5488 16.9394 15.3535L12 10.4142L7.06071 15.3535C6.86544 15.5488 6.54886 15.5488 6.3536 15.3535L5.64649 14.6464C5.45123 14.4512 5.45123 14.1346 5.64649 13.9393L11.6465 7.93933C11.8418 7.74406 12.1583 7.74406 12.3536 7.93933L18.3536 13.9393Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><div style="height:0" class="toggle__ToggleContentsContainer-sc-e0810304-0 eeQJDZ"><div class="toggle__ToggleBlockDescriptionWrapper-sc-c261c5ac-2 ebWLuA"><div align="left" class="career-text__Textstyled-sc-d4647b24-0 hzhMTi"><p>A. 포지션 별로 변경 가능 여부가 상이하오니, 인터뷰를 안내 받으신 메일로 비대면 변경 가능 여부를 문의해 주세요.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="toggle__ToggleBlockContentContainer-sc-c261c5ac-0 jptlpY"><div style="cursor:pointer" class="sc-gFVuLS ujPNE toggle__ToggleBlockTitleContainer-sc-c261c5ac-1 irQwbf"><h3 align="left" class="career-text__Textstyled-sc-d4647b24-0 dPSVFW"><p>Q. 사전에 전달 받을 수 있는 인터뷰 상세사항이 있을까요?</p></h3><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="toggle-arrow" color="var(--x171smmw)" style="flex-shrink:0"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M18.3536 13.9393C18.5489 14.1346 18.5489 14.4512 18.3536 14.6464L17.6465 15.3535C17.4512 15.5488 17.1346 15.5488 16.9394 15.3535L12 10.4142L7.06071 15.3535C6.86544 15.5488 6.54886 15.5488 6.3536 15.3535L5.64649 14.6464C5.45123 14.4512 5.45123 14.1346 5.64649 13.9393L11.6465 7.93933C11.8418 7.74406 12.1583 7.74406 12.3536 7.93933L18.3536 13.9393Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><div style="height:0" class="toggle__ToggleContentsContainer-sc-e0810304-0 eeQJDZ"><div class="toggle__ToggleBlockDescriptionWrapper-sc-c261c5ac-2 ebWLuA"><div align="left" class="career-text__Textstyled-sc-d4647b24-0 hzhMTi"><p>A. 진행중인 전형과 관련하여 궁금하신 점은 채용팀(<a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="2f5d4a4c5d5a465b6f425a5c46415c4e014c4042">[email&#160;protected]</a>)으로 성함과 지원 포지션 명을 기재하여 문의해 주세요.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="layout__Container-sc-2396a3cf-0 gcMYSU layout"><div class="layout__PageContainer-sc-2396a3cf-1 jvmtii layout"><div class="layout__ColumnWrapper-sc-2396a3cf-2 bLxIzA"><div class="column__ColumnContainer-sc-32f87c75-0 eDqbtp"><div background="[object Object]" class="column__Container-sc-32f87c75-1 cVUTES column" id="e75738ab-96f1-4d81-9bef-d1f1128204a8" blocks="[object Object]" brandColor="#000000"><div style="position:relative" class="sc-kAkozD fCdkMv"><div id="8f712c46-2a36-4c18-9829-222c1e69e037" type="blank" blank="[object Object]" class="blank__Blank-sc-f3cd2325-0 gakHuU"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="layout__Container-sc-2396a3cf-0 gcMYSU layout"><div class="layout__PageContainer-sc-2396a3cf-1 jvmtii layout"><div class="layout__ColumnWrapper-sc-2396a3cf-2 bLxIzA"><div class="column__ColumnContainer-sc-32f87c75-0 BeFrH"><div background="[object Object]" class="column__Container-sc-32f87c75-1 cVUTES column" id="f248a39a-2185-488b-8ff1-f9b53a311953" blocks="[object Object],[object Object]" brandColor="#000000"><div style="position:relative" class="sc-kAkozD fCdkMv"><div id="d5b11bf0-79c2-46ac-adbb-79edbfcd0bb4" type="blank" blank="[object Object]" class="blank__Blank-sc-f3cd2325-0 gakHtD"></div><h3 brandColor="#000000" id="c6a07478-c052-4f0d-90d1-78328585b510" type="text" align="left" content="&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);&quot;&gt;기타&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" background="[object Object]" class="career-text__Textstyled-sc-d4647b24-0 dPSVFW text__Container-sc-ee98b209-0 gRMXeC"><p><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34)">기타</span></p></h3></div></div></div><div class="column__ColumnContainer-sc-32f87c75-0 lgbWbm"><div background="[object Object]" class="column__Container-sc-32f87c75-1 cVUTES column" id="aa6debca-9a75-4d94-b6e0-8a6d368b5060" blocks="[object Object]" brandColor="#000000"><div style="position:relative" class="sc-kAkozD fCdkMv"><div class="sc-kAkozD cPifFj toggle__ToggleBlockContainer-sc-c261c5ac-3 jZVMUB"><div class="toggle__ToggleBlockContentContainer-sc-c261c5ac-0 jptlpY"><div style="cursor:pointer" class="sc-gFVuLS ujPNE toggle__ToggleBlockTitleContainer-sc-c261c5ac-1 irQwbf"><h3 align="left" class="career-text__Textstyled-sc-d4647b24-0 dPSVFW"><p>Q. 특정 포지션이 재오픈 되었을 때 알림을 받을 수 있을까요?</p></h3><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="toggle-arrow" color="var(--x171smmw)" style="flex-shrink:0"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M18.3536 13.9393C18.5489 14.1346 18.5489 14.4512 18.3536 14.6464L17.6465 15.3535C17.4512 15.5488 17.1346 15.5488 16.9394 15.3535L12 10.4142L7.06071 15.3535C6.86544 15.5488 6.54886 15.5488 6.3536 15.3535L5.64649 14.6464C5.45123 14.4512 5.45123 14.1346 5.64649 13.9393L11.6465 7.93933C11.8418 7.74406 12.1583 7.74406 12.3536 7.93933L18.3536 13.9393Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><div style="height:0" class="toggle__ToggleContentsContainer-sc-e0810304-0 eeQJDZ"><div class="toggle__ToggleBlockDescriptionWrapper-sc-c261c5ac-2 ebWLuA"><div align="left" class="career-text__Textstyled-sc-d4647b24-0 hzhMTi"><p id="isPasted">A. 아쉽게도 특정 포지션의 재오픈 여부를 개별적으로 안내드리기 어려운 점 양해 부탁드려요. </p><p>무신사에서 채용 중인 모든 공고는 링크(https://www.musinsacareers.com/)에 업데이트되고 있으니, 수시로 확인해 주세요.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="toggle__ToggleBlockContentContainer-sc-c261c5ac-0 jptlpY"><div style="cursor:pointer" class="sc-gFVuLS ujPNE toggle__ToggleBlockTitleContainer-sc-c261c5ac-1 irQwbf"><h3 align="left" class="career-text__Textstyled-sc-d4647b24-0 dPSVFW"><p>Q. 인재풀로 서류 보관 요청이 가능할까요? </p></h3><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="toggle-arrow" color="var(--x171smmw)" style="flex-shrink:0"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M18.3536 13.9393C18.5489 14.1346 18.5489 14.4512 18.3536 14.6464L17.6465 15.3535C17.4512 15.5488 17.1346 15.5488 16.9394 15.3535L12 10.4142L7.06071 15.3535C6.86544 15.5488 6.54886 15.5488 6.3536 15.3535L5.64649 14.6464C5.45123 14.4512 5.45123 14.1346 5.64649 13.9393L11.6465 7.93933C11.8418 7.74406 12.1583 7.74406 12.3536 7.93933L18.3536 13.9393Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><div style="height:0" class="toggle__ToggleContentsContainer-sc-e0810304-0 eeQJDZ"><div class="toggle__ToggleBlockDescriptionWrapper-sc-c261c5ac-2 ebWLuA"><div align="left" class="career-text__Textstyled-sc-d4647b24-0 hzhMTi"><p>A. 별도의 인재풀을 운영하고 있지 않는 점 양해 부탁드려요.</p><p>앞으로 유사한 포지션이 열릴 경우, 채용 홈페이지(https://www.musinsacareers.com/)에서 먼저 안내드리고 있어요.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="toggle__ToggleBlockContentContainer-sc-c261c5ac-0 jptlpY"><div style="cursor:pointer" class="sc-gFVuLS ujPNE toggle__ToggleBlockTitleContainer-sc-c261c5ac-1 irQwbf"><h3 align="left" class="career-text__Textstyled-sc-d4647b24-0 dPSVFW"><p>Q. 인턴/계약직 포지션은 정규직 전환이 가능한가요?</p></h3><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="toggle-arrow" color="var(--x171smmw)" style="flex-shrink:0"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M18.3536 13.9393C18.5489 14.1346 18.5489 14.4512 18.3536 14.6464L17.6465 15.3535C17.4512 15.5488 17.1346 15.5488 16.9394 15.3535L12 10.4142L7.06071 15.3535C6.86544 15.5488 6.54886 15.5488 6.3536 15.3535L5.64649 14.6464C5.45123 14.4512 5.45123 14.1346 5.64649 13.9393L11.6465 7.93933C11.8418 7.74406 12.1583 7.74406 12.3536 7.93933L18.3536 13.9393Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><div style="height:0" class="toggle__ToggleContentsContainer-sc-e0810304-0 eeQJDZ"><div class="toggle__ToggleBlockDescriptionWrapper-sc-c261c5ac-2 ebWLuA"><div align="left" class="career-text__Textstyled-sc-d4647b24-0 hzhMTi"><p><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34)">A. 정규직 전환 포지션인 경우, 해당 포지션 내에 안내 드리고 있어요.</span></p><p><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34)">다만 전환은 개인의 업무 수행 능력과 퍼포먼스에 따라 달라지며, 전환이 반드시 보장되지는 않는 점 참고해주세요.</span></p><p><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34)">정규직 전환이 기재되지 않은 인턴/계약직 포지션의 경우, 전환이 예정되어 있지 않은 포지션이예요.</span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="toggle__ToggleBlockContentContainer-sc-c261c5ac-0 jptlpY"><div style="cursor:pointer" class="sc-gFVuLS ujPNE toggle__ToggleBlockTitleContainer-sc-c261c5ac-1 irQwbf"><h3 align="left" class="career-text__Textstyled-sc-d4647b24-0 dPSVFW"><p>Q. 외부 채용 플랫폼에 기재된 내용과 다른데, 무엇이 맞을까요?</p></h3><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="toggle-arrow" color="var(--x171smmw)" style="flex-shrink:0"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M18.3536 13.9393C18.5489 14.1346 18.5489 14.4512 18.3536 14.6464L17.6465 15.3535C17.4512 15.5488 17.1346 15.5488 16.9394 15.3535L12 10.4142L7.06071 15.3535C6.86544 15.5488 6.54886 15.5488 6.3536 15.3535L5.64649 14.6464C5.45123 14.4512 5.45123 14.1346 5.64649 13.9393L11.6465 7.93933C11.8418 7.74406 12.1583 7.74406 12.3536 7.93933L18.3536 13.9393Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><div style="height:0" class="toggle__ToggleContentsContainer-sc-e0810304-0 eeQJDZ"><div class="toggle__ToggleBlockDescriptionWrapper-sc-c261c5ac-2 ebWLuA"><div align="left" class="career-text__Textstyled-sc-d4647b24-0 hzhMTi"><p>A. 무신사 공식 채용 페이지를 참고하여 지원해 주세요. 외부 채용 플랫폼에 올라온 내용이 상이할 경우 채용팀(<a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="d3a1b6b0a1a6baa793bea6a0babda0b2fdb0bcbe">[email&#160;protected]</a>)으로 제보해주시면 신속히 확인 후 처리할게요.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="toggle__ToggleBlockContentContainer-sc-c261c5ac-0 jptlpY"><div style="cursor:pointer" class="sc-gFVuLS ujPNE toggle__ToggleBlockTitleContainer-sc-c261c5ac-1 irQwbf"><h3 align="left" class="career-text__Textstyled-sc-d4647b24-0 dPSVFW"><p>Q. 수습 제도는 어떻게 운영되고 있나요?</p></h3><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="toggle-arrow" color="var(--x171smmw)" style="flex-shrink:0"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M18.3536 13.9393C18.5489 14.1346 18.5489 14.4512 18.3536 14.6464L17.6465 15.3535C17.4512 15.5488 17.1346 15.5488 16.9394 15.3535L12 10.4142L7.06071 15.3535C6.86544 15.5488 6.54886 15.5488 6.3536 15.3535L5.64649 14.6464C5.45123 14.4512 5.45123 14.1346 5.64649 13.9393L11.6465 7.93933C11.8418 7.74406 12.1583 7.74406 12.3536 7.93933L18.3536 13.9393Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><div style="height:0" class="toggle__ToggleContentsContainer-sc-e0810304-0 eeQJDZ"><div class="toggle__ToggleBlockDescriptionWrapper-sc-c261c5ac-2 ebWLuA"><div align="left" class="career-text__Textstyled-sc-d4647b24-0 hzhMTi"><p>A. 신규 입사자(12개월 이상 계약직, 정규직)는 3개월의 수습 기간 동안 수습 평가를 진행하고 있으며, 수습 기간에도 100% 급여와 복지 혜택이 적용 돼요.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="toggle__ToggleBlockContentContainer-sc-c261c5ac-0 jptlpY"><div style="cursor:pointer" class="sc-gFVuLS ujPNE toggle__ToggleBlockTitleContainer-sc-c261c5ac-1 irQwbf"><h3 align="left" class="career-text__Textstyled-sc-d4647b24-0 dPSVFW"><p>Q. 어떤 복지들이 있나요?</p></h3><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="toggle-arrow" color="var(--x171smmw)" style="flex-shrink:0"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M18.3536 13.9393C18.5489 14.1346 18.5489 14.4512 18.3536 14.6464L17.6465 15.3535C17.4512 15.5488 17.1346 15.5488 16.9394 15.3535L12 10.4142L7.06071 15.3535C6.86544 15.5488 6.54886 15.5488 6.3536 15.3535L5.64649 14.6464C5.45123 14.4512 5.45123 14.1346 5.64649 13.9393L11.6465 7.93933C11.8418 7.74406 12.1583 7.74406 12.3536 7.93933L18.3536 13.9393Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><div style="height:0" class="toggle__ToggleContentsContainer-sc-e0810304-0 eeQJDZ"><div class="toggle__ToggleBlockDescriptionWrapper-sc-c261c5ac-2 ebWLuA"><div align="left" class="career-text__Textstyled-sc-d4647b24-0 hzhMTi"><p>A. 무신사의 복리후생은 링크(https://www.musinsacareers.com/ko/benefit)에서 확인하실 수 있어요. 다만, 해당 복지는 근무 장소, 기간 및 시점에 따라 일부 변경되어 적용될 수 있는 점 참고해주세요.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="toggle__ToggleBlockContentContainer-sc-c261c5ac-0 jptlpY"><div style="cursor:pointer" class="sc-gFVuLS ujPNE toggle__ToggleBlockTitleContainer-sc-c261c5ac-1 irQwbf"><h3 align="left" class="career-text__Textstyled-sc-d4647b24-0 dPSVFW"><p>Q. 공식적인 채용 공고는 어디에서 볼 수 있나요?</p></h3><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="toggle-arrow" color="var(--x171smmw)" style="flex-shrink:0"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M18.3536 13.9393C18.5489 14.1346 18.5489 14.4512 18.3536 14.6464L17.6465 15.3535C17.4512 15.5488 17.1346 15.5488 16.9394 15.3535L12 10.4142L7.06071 15.3535C6.86544 15.5488 6.54886 15.5488 6.3536 15.3535L5.64649 14.6464C5.45123 14.4512 5.45123 14.1346 5.64649 13.9393L11.6465 7.93933C11.8418 7.74406 12.1583 7.74406 12.3536 7.93933L18.3536 13.9393Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><div style="height:0" class="toggle__ToggleContentsContainer-sc-e0810304-0 eeQJDZ"><div class="toggle__ToggleBlockDescriptionWrapper-sc-c261c5ac-2 ebWLuA"><div align="left" class="career-text__Textstyled-sc-d4647b24-0 hzhMTi"><p>A. 무신사에서 채용 중인 모든 포지션은 링크(https://www.musinsacareers.com/)에서 확인하실 수 있어요.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="layout__Container-sc-2396a3cf-0 gcMYSU layout"><div class="layout__PageContainer-sc-2396a3cf-1 jvmtii layout"><div class="layout__ColumnWrapper-sc-2396a3cf-2 bLxIzA"><div class="column__ColumnContainer-sc-32f87c75-0 eDqbtp"><div background="[object Object]" class="column__Container-sc-32f87c75-1 cVUTES column" id="7bb84f0d-9a07-4bb5-8d0f-961f06be24aa" blocks="[object Object]" brandColor="#000000"><div style="position:relative" class="sc-kAkozD fCdkMv"><div id="d8ebd32d-6eba-4f1